Common PartialCourseTranscriptAwards
    documentation "A collection of partial credits and/or grades a student earned against the course over the session, used when awards of credit are incremental."
    date AwardDate
        documentation "The date the partial credits and/or grades were awarded or earned."
        is part of identity
    shared decimal CreditsValue named EarnedCredits
        documentation "The number of credits a student earned for completing a given course."
        is required
    descriptor MethodCreditEarned
        documentation "The method the credits were earned."
        is optional
    shared string GradeEarned named LetterGradeEarned
        documentation "The indicator of student performance as submitted by the instructor."
        is optional
    shared string GradeEarned named NumericGradeEarned
        documentation "The indicator of student performance as submitted by the instructor."
        is optional
